			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 401490101,
					"content": "...How time flies. My burns are almost healed now, so I should be ready to take back the kitchen tomorrow.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401490102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Smiley Yanxiao"
				},
				{
					"id": 401490102,
					"content": "#You've really gone above and beyond these past few days, {NICKNAME}. Last day today — here's hoping we get through it without incident.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401490103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Smiley Yanxiao"
				},
				{
					"id": 401490103,
					"content": "Ugh, why does Paimon feel like you just jinxed us again...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401490104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401490104,
					"content": "The day passes without incident...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401490105
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401490105,
					"content": "Whew, we made it all the way to the evening! It ended up being a pretty smooth day after all. Maybe it's because we've gotten so experienced at running this whole thing?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401490106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401490106,
					"content": "We've come a long way since our first day on the job, haven't we? Back then, we were struggling to remember who ordered what... But everything's a piece of cake now!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401490107,
						401490108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401490107,
					"content": "Don't get ahead of yourself...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401490109
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401490109,
					"content": "Yeah, but who would come by this late in the evening? Oh... Actually, now that Paimon thinks about it, Lyney and his siblings came around this time on the first day, didn't they...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401490110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401490110,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}? Paimon? Fancy seeing you two here!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401490111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Amber"
				},
				{
					"id": 401490111,
					"content": "Amber? And Eula and Mika, too! Are you here for dinner? Why so late in the day?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401490112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401490112,
					"content": "We just finished an escort mission for a merchant caravan. The original plan was to make do with some rations for this evening and continue our trek north towards Stone Gate...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401490113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mika"
				},
				{
					"id": 401490113,
					"content": "But Captain Eula brought up the fact that none of us have eaten Liyue cuisine for quite some time. We thought we might as well swing by the inn and see if we can still order something.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401490114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mika"
				},
				{
					"id": 401490114,
					"content": "Ooh, so this is Eula's treat, huh?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401490115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401490115,
					"content": "...Ahem! We've been eating the same rations for the entire trip, so I simply thought it was high time we had ourselves a proper meal. Do you have a problem with that?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401490116,
						401490117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Eula"
				},
				{
					"id": 401490116,
					"content": "Well, welcome to Wangshu Inn.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401490118
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401490118,
					"content": "Good question, what should we get... Hmm? Wait a sec, why are you taking our order?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401490119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Eula"
				},
				{
					"id": 401490119,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}'s been filling in for the chef here! You've come at just the right time — you'll be the last customers to enjoy {M#his}{F#her} cooking before the original chef takes back the reins!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401490120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401490120,
					"content": "Wow, really? Good thing Eula suggested we come here! I wouldn't wanna miss this!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401490121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Amber"
				},
				{
					"id": 401490121,
					"content": "So, what shall we get? Hmm... I'm not as familiar with Liyue cuisine as I used to be. Mika, Eula, what are you in the mood for?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401490122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Amber"
				},
				{
					"id": 401490122,
					"content": "Anything goes! I'm just looking forward to trying the Honorary Knight's cooking for myself. I'm sure it'll be a great learning opportunity for me!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401490123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mika"
				},
				{
					"id": 401490123,
					"content": "...Something small, I suppose. We have to hit the road again after we eat. Beyond that, anything goes.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401490124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Eula"
				},
				{
					"id": 401490124,
					"content": "Wasn't it your idea to come here, though? Yeesh, this is like getting blood from a stone... Alright, guess it's up to you, Amber. You name it, we'll cook it!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401490125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401490125,
					"content": "Huh? Then I guess... Eh, I don't really mind either. Anything goes.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401490126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Amber"
				},
				{
					"id": 401490126,
					"content": "Ugh!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401490117,
					"content": "May I take your order?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401490118
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401490108,
					"content": "The day still isn't over yet.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401490109
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 4014902,
